{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Pikotaro's LULLABY LA LA BY (TV)","Pikotarou is inspired by an illustration drawn by director Taniguchi and tells a three-minute fairy tail ad-lib based on it. The episodes are told as \"Bedtime Stories\" that Pikotarou visits the protagonists of famous fairy tails, such as The Little Match Girl and Little Red Riding Hood. Pikotarou will voice himself and all other characters in the show.\n\n\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)"],"ja":["ピコ太郎のララバイラーラバイ (TV)",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":36520,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-35739","ids":{"shikimori":35739,"mal":35739,"anilist":99083,"kodik":"serial-67908"},"kodikIds":["serial-36788","serial-67908"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-36788":"2021-08-21T13:56:26Z","serial-67908":"2025-06-19T18:00:54Z"},"title":"Колыбельная Пикотаро","originalTitle":"Pikotarou no Lullaby Luullaby","alt":"Колыбельная Пикотаро [ТВ] / Pikotaro's Lullaby La La By / Pikotarou no Lullaby Lullaby (TV) Pikotaro's LULLABY LA LA BY (TV) ピコ太郎のララバイラーラバイ (TV)","description":"Японский комедиант Пикотаро , известный по песне «PPAP (Pen-Pineapple-Apple-Pen)», вдохнул жизнь и весь свой продюсерский потенциал в новые трёхминутные скетчи о сновидце с собственным анимированным лицом. Каждый эпизод представлен в виде сказки на ночь со специфическим юмором, песнями и моралью.","year":2017,"type":"TV","genres":["Комедия","пародия"],"rating":5.61,"popularity":1799,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[36520],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/35739/dca6cef04c4fe0d25fa18ccd8d6da388.jpeg","width":354,"height":500},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/5199d5c48561232599a5483b36fbf9f56e89f5cf.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening"